<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Happy Birthday, Tash ❤️</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16000b, #350015, #120006);
      color: white;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .hearts {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      overflow: hidden;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .heart {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -50px;
      font-size: 20px;
      animation: float 8s linear infinite;
      opacity: 0.65;
    }

    .heart:nth-child(1) { left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
    .heart:nth-child(2) { left: 25%; animation-delay: 2s; }
    .heart:nth-child(3) { left: 45%; animation-delay: 4s; }
    .heart:nth-child(4) { left: 65%; animation-delay: 1s; }
    .heart:nth-child(5) { left: 85%; animation-delay: 3s; }

    @keyframes float {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      20% { opacity: 0.7; }
      100% {
        transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }

    .container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px 50px;
    }

    .small-title {
      color: #ff9bb9;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(50px, 12vw, 95px);
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .birthday {
      font-size: clamp(22px, 5vw, 34px);
      color: #ffd6e2;
    }

    .heart-big {
      font-size: 50px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      animation: beat 1.5s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes beat {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
      50% { transform: scale(1.15); }
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 25px;
      padding: 35px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }

    .card h2 {
      color: #ffb6ca;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #f5dfe6;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .memory {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 45px 20px;
    }

    .memory h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #ffb6ca;
    }

    .memory p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #f3dce4;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .gallery img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 400px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .gallery img:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }

    .videos {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    video {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: black;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }

    .closing {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px;
    }

    .closing h2 {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      color: #ffb6ca;
    }

    .closing p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #f6dfe7;
    }

    .signature {
      margin-top: 35px;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: white;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      color: #b98a99;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .gallery,
      .videos {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .gallery img {
        height: 450px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 25px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="hearts">
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>
    <div class="heart">💗</div>
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>
    <div class="heart">💕</div>
    <div class="heart">❤️</div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="small-title">A little something for you</div>

      <h1>Tash</h1>

      <div class="birthday">
        Happy Birthday, my love ❤️
      </div>

      <div class="heart-big">♥</div>

      <p style="color:#e9cbd5; font-size:17px;">
        Today is about celebrating you.
      </p>
    </section>


    <!-- MESSAGE -->
    <section class="card">
      <h2>For You, Tash ❤️</h2>

      <p>
        Happy birthday, Tash.
        <br><br>

        I honestly don't know if words can perfectly explain what you mean
        to me, but I still wanted to try.

        <br><br>

        The day we met is still one of the days I remember with a special
        kind of smile. I didn't know then where life would take us,
        but meeting you became one of those moments I'm genuinely grateful
        happened.

        <br><br>

        We've had our beautiful moments, our complicated moments,
        and everything in between. But regardless of where we are at any
        particular moment, I can't pretend that the memories we've made
        don't mean something to me.

        <br><br>

        You have been a special part of my life, and today I just want you
        to know that I appreciate you.

        <br><br>

        I hope this new year of your life brings you happiness,
        peace, beautiful memories and everything you're working towards.

        <br><br>

        Happy birthday, Tash. ❤️
      </p>
    </section>


    <!-- THE DAY WE MET -->
    <section class="memory">

      <h2>The Day We Met</h2>

      <p>
        Some days pass like any other day.
        Then there are days that quietly become memories you'll always
        remember.

        <br><br>

        The day I met you was one of those days for me.

        <br><br>

        I may not have known how important that moment would become,
        but looking back, I'm glad our paths crossed.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- PHOTOS -->
    <section class="card">

      <h2>Our Little Memories 📸</h2>

      <div class="gallery">

        <!-- Replace these filenames with your photos -->
        <img src="photo1.jpg" alt="Our memory">
        <img src="photo2.jpg" alt="Our memory">

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- VIDEOS -->
    <section class="card">

      <h2>Moments Worth Keeping 🎥</h2>

      <div class="videos">

        <!-- Replace these filenames with your videos -->
        <video controls>
          <source src="video1.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          Your browser does not support video.
        </video>

        <video controls>
          <source src="video2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          Your browser does not support video.
        </video>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- CLOSING -->
    <section class="closing">

      <h2>One More Thing ❤️</h2>

      <p>
        I don't want to make this birthday message about pretending
        everything is perfect.

        <br><br>

        I just want it to be real.

        <br><br>

        Whatever life brings, I'll always be grateful for the moments,
        the laughs, the memories, and especially for the day our paths
        crossed.

        <br><br>

        So today, I hope you smile a little more, laugh a little louder,
        and remember that someone out here is genuinely wishing you
        a beautiful birthday.

        <br><br>

        Happy Birthday, Tash. ❤️
      </p>

      <div class="signature">
        — Steve ❤️
      </div>

    </section>

    <footer>
      Made with love, memories & a little bit of HTML ❤️
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
